"""A name for each rack (spec 18, Phase 2): a tablet now makes its own rack and names it.

WHY: racks were numbered slots; now each is called something ("Rack 3", "Platform"),
changeable from the tablet or Room Layout. Existing tablets on a rack are named
"Rack N" here, so a set-up gym looks the same after the update.
"""
